<title>JAPAN: Shohkoh Fund falls on share offering plan.</title>
<headline>Shohkoh Fund falls on share offering plan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Shohkoh Fund &amp; Co Ltd fell on Friday morning, depressed by news that the firm was planning to offer new shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0053 GMT, the shares stood at 29,800 yen after closing at 30,500 yen on the previous day.</p>
